{"product":{"id":10040245715232,"title":"Terreno PRO T30 Fine Loose Gravel Race","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eDesigned for speed on dry and fast courses, the T30's unique fish scale center strip minimizes rolling resistance while maintaining control under braking and cornering. Siped shoulder knobs bite confidently into off-camber sections, while a gradual ramp-up design ensures a smooth, predictable transition when leaning into turns. Compared to the average competitor, it is 7% faster, 9% grippier, and 34% more puncture resistant. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut we wanted more from this range. The Terreno PRO range is built with 92% renewable and recycled materials, making it the most sustainable tire Vittoria has ever created, proving that going green doesn’t mean compromising on winning.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a 49% lower carbon footprint versus the Gravel Endurance construction, Terreno PRO T30 Fine Loose Gravel Race shows that sustainability and speed can ride side by side. Awarded the Gold Award and Green Prize at the 2024 Taipei Cycle Show d\u0026amp;i Awards, the Terreno Pro range represents the new era of cycling.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"Gravel Tire","created_at":"2025-09-04T20:59:00-05:00","handle":"terreno-pro-t30-fine-loose-gravel-race","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:04-05:00","published_at":"2025-11-11T08:58:58-06:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"global","tags":"Discounted products, EP70, Gravel, Gravel Race, IPP40, Tires","variants":[{"id":50664001700128,"product_id":10040245715232,"title":"700x35c \/ Brown","price":"112.99","sku":"11A00850","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"700x35c","option2":"Brown","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-09-04T20:59:01-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:04-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"8022530037570","grams":550,"image_id":50974181818656,"weight":550.0,"weight_unit":"g","tax_code":"","require